        },
        {
          "text": " Uwiteka abwirira Mose mu butayu bwa Sinayi ari mu ihema ry'ibonaniro, ku munsi wa mbere w'ukwezi kwa kabiri k'umwaka wa kabiri bavuye mu gihugu cya Egiputa, ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mubare umubare w'iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli ryose nk'uko imiryango yabo iri, nk'uko amazu ya ba sekuru ari, mubare amazina y'abagabo bose umwe umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamaze imyaka makumyabiri cyangwa isāga bavutse, abo mu Bisirayeli bose babasha gutabara, wowe na Aroni mubabare uko imitwe yabo iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufatanye n'umuntu wo mu muryango wose w'umutware w'inzu ya ba sekuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
