        {
          "text": "Bandika amavuko y'Abarubeni imfura ya Isirayeli nk'uko imiryango yabo iri, nk'uko amazu ya ba sekuru ari, babara amazina y'abagabo bose umwe umwe, bamaze imyaka makumyabiri bavutse cyangwa isāga, ababasha gutabara bose. ",
