            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ababazwe bose bo mu Bisirayeli nk'uko amazu ya ba sekuru ari, bamaze imyaka makumyabiri bavutse cyangwa isāga, abo mu Bisirayeli babasha gutabara bose; ",
