          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ariko uwo muryango wa Lewi wo ntuzawubare, ntubarane umubare wabo n'Abisirayeli bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahubwo Abalewi ubagire abarinzi b'ubuturo bw'Ibihamya, n'ab'ibintu byo muri bwo byose, n'ab'ibyabwo byose. Bajye baremērwa ubwo buturo n'ibintu byo muri bwo bwose, abe ari bo bajya bakoreramo imirimo, bajye babugotesha amahema yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi uko ubwo buturo buhagurutse, Abalewi abe ari bo bajya babushingura, kandi uko bugiye kubambwa, Abalewi abe ari bo babushinga. Utari uwo muri bo wigizwa hafi no kubyishyiramo yicwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bajye babamba amahema yabo, umuntu wese mu cyiciro cy'amahema y'ababo, umuntu wese ahererane n'ibendera ry'ababo nk'uko imitwe yabo iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Abalewi bakikize amahema yabo ubuturo bw'Ibihamya, kugira ngo umujinya utaba ku iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli. Abalewi bitondere umurimo wo kurinda ubuturo bw'Ibihamya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko abe ari ko Abisirayeli bakora, uko Uwiteka yategetse Mose kose abe ari ko bakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.54"
            ]
          }
